<section class="card mb-4" aria-labelledby="bid-pricing-heading">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h2 id="bid-pricing-heading" class="h5">Price summary</h2>
        <p>Tax is 16% of item prices only. Fees, shipping, installation and maintenance are added afterwards.</p>
        <dl class="row mb-0" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
            <dt class="col-7">Items subtotal</dt><dd class="col-5 text-end text-break" data-pricing-subtotal>—</dd>
            <dt class="col-7">Tax (16% on items)</dt><dd class="col-5 text-end text-break" data-pricing-tax>—</dd>
            <dt class="col-7">Total including tax and extras</dt><dd class="col-5 text-end text-break fw-bold" data-pricing-total>—</dd>
        </dl>
        <p class="small mb-0">Amounts are in the selected currency. The final amounts are recalculated when you submit.</p>
        <noscript><p class="mt-2 mb-0">Live totals require JavaScript. Tax and total will still be calculated when you submit.</p></noscript>
    </div>
</section>
